{"v":4,"catch":"「命運的齒輪，如今再次轉動！」","desc":"經精心設計、富有挑戰性的2D動作加上精緻的圖像，王道《Mega Man》以最新姿態回歸。新功能「Double-gear System」能在任何時間大幅強化Mega Man的力量和速度，令遊玩體驗變得比以往作品更自由和爽快。另外，豐富的難度選擇亦能為很久沒玩的玩家提供最適合的選擇。\n\n除了遊戲本篇之外，還收錄能挑戰時間競速等任務，跟全球玩家爭奪排名的「Challenge」模式，以及閱覽角色設定的「Gallery」模式。","publisher":"CAPCOM","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 2.6GB / Switch 2.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/07017ca90e7139773cfecf7bcfc111ffd7e819a89972a3588f3de31887e85d64.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3fdca00e40534cdb8a2838e66fa88e0e0c25e09091234a2c6606fd1f7d1aabb2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7e5f75521ad66f173fc25c2ea7f092175bcf67bb3802f0ebf8c177b02a91921.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/58b0e2fdac5b9c11f37b84e4e6704cf180476486f36fcc5d467e742af45a984d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e9268c53d86460fb6d07c0ba89e856d26f31f8d2e414bfdffd39ed926dddff0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/afa192ef27ec2193fb179bb096762e2d53bc9fc679a6be673a80763cae83e8da.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b0c0086b0000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000062253","name":"Wily Numbers: Instrumental Stage Tracks","img":"eb972562d1ed4b906018e26ea9e008c048859e6259c2365f7395452123fc7604","date":"2025-10-02","mem":false}],"vids":["tw8ingUhKWU"]}